# Coverage gap meets/meets/meets union (research/kernel-audit/coverage.md): two boxes meeting at one
# corner. The union is not a manifold there and should be refused (ZeroThickness at (20, 20, 20));
# today `build` reports a valid body.
shared S = 40
shared H = 20
shared s = 10
sketch plan(on: xy) {
  outline = rect(corner: (-S / 2, -S / 2), size: (S, S))
}
base = extrude(plan, H)
sketch top(on: base.end) {
  sq = rect(corner: (S / 2, S / 2), size: (s, s))
}
tool = extrude(top.sq, s)
